# Decodo

> Decodo (formerly Smartproxy) is a proxy and web scraping platform for large-scale public web data collection. It provides residential, ISP, datacenter, and mobile proxies, as well as Web Scraping API (including Web, SERP, eCommerce, and social media targets) that help businesses bypass IP bans and CAPTCHAs, enabling efficient and reliable access to public web data. Decodo serves market research, eCommerce, SEO, and data science teams with scalable networks, granular geo-targeting, and developer-focused tooling.

